            Horchata flavors disappear often, as Jocko Molk, Earth Fed Muscle and Panda show, so check the brand's own store before paying a reseller. And if your favorite is gone, a vanilla whey, a pinch of Ceylon cinnamon and rice milk get you most of the way. Our <a href="/jocko-protein-powder-review/">Jocko review</a> and <a href="/compare/">protein comparisons</a> can help you pick the base.
          </p>
